{% assign is_zh = false %}
{% if page.lang contains 'zh' %}{% assign is_zh = true %}{% endif %}
<section class="student-status">
  <div class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div>
    <strong>{% if is_zh %}当前情况{% else %}Availability{% endif %}</strong>
    <p>
      {% if is_zh %}
        目前暂无已确认并可公布的招生或科研实习名额；后续确定后将在本页更新。欢迎对相关方向感兴趣的同学和潜在合作伙伴联系交流。
      {% else %}
        There are currently no confirmed student positions or research internship opportunities to announce. Future opportunities will be posted here.
        In the meantime, I welcome conversations with prospective students and potential collaborators.
      {% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="student-section">
  <div class="section-kicker">{% if is_zh %}研究方向{% else %}Research topics{% endif %}</div>
  <h2>{% if is_zh %}可交流的研究主题{% else %}Potential research topics{% endif %}</h2>
  <div class="topic-grid">
    {% for area in site.data.research %}
      <article>
        <span>{{ area.number }}</span>
        <h3>{% if is_zh %}{{ area.title_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.title_en }}{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>{% if is_zh %}{{ area.tagline_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.tagline_en }}{% endif %}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="student-section contact-guide">
  <div>
    <div class="section-kicker">{% if is_zh %}联系方式{% else %}Contact{% endif %}</div>
    <h2>{% if is_zh %}联系前请提供的信息{% else %}What to include in your email{% endif %}</h2>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p>
      {% if is_zh %}
        请简要介绍你的教育背景、感兴趣的具体研究问题、相关经历或作品，以及预计开始时间和可投入周期。
      {% else %}
        A useful first message briefly introduces your background, the concrete question that interests you,
        any relevant work, and your expected timeline. Clarity matters more than length.
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <span class="primary-text-link">{{ site.data.profile.email_bupt }}</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="teaching-placeholder">
  <strong>{% if is_zh %}课程与指导{% else %}Teaching & mentoring{% endif %}</strong>
  <span>
    {% if is_zh %}课程与指导信息将在确定后补充。{% else %}Course and mentoring information will be added as it becomes available.{% endif %}
  </span>
</section>
